# Suites and trials that the ESP32-S3_raw trial target does not run, each with its reason.
# A skipped suite or trial is reported as skipped, never as passed. Keep the reasons honest:
#   target: -- the board target cannot run it (a missing runtime, no OS, a hardware limit)
#   driver: -- the board trial driver does not handle this suite's layout yet
#
#   <suite>                 <reason>     the whole suite
#   <suite>/<trial-stem>    <reason>     one trial
#
# Sub-suites (subdirectories with their own Makefile, e.g. under error_enforcement_addition) are
# skipped by the driver automatically and reported as such; they need no entry here.

actor_stacks_addition            target: the board grows actor stacks by heap chunks (item F), but these trials recurse hundreds of thousands of frames deep and expect megabytes committed, more than the ~350 KB heap; stack_budget_board_addition covers growth and release on the board
actors_addition/string_concat_cast_stress          target: 10,000 distinct strings on the ~300 KB bump heap (the host frees nothing either, but has gigabytes)
actors_addition/aggregate_return_in_actor_keeps_stack  target: 100,000 casts queued before the receiver runs (main never yields while sending); 4.8 MB of message nodes on a ~300 KB heap
compiler_addition/substring_utf8_cursor          target: ~940 KB of never-freed intermediate strings on a ~170 KB heap (the host frees no strings either)
device_actor_stm32_addition      target: the NUCLEO-L476RG device-actor trials map STM32L476RG windows (RCC, GPIOA/C, USART2) and carry STM32-L476RG_raw goldens only
memory_region_addition/region_chain_free_walked        target: three 1.6 MB buffers (200000 int64) per region on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_conditional         target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_pass_and_return     target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_move_pass_no_return      target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
memory_region_addition/region_scope_loop_release       target: a 200000-int64 (1.6 MB) buffer on a ~170 KB heap (untouched pages cost nothing on the host)
supervisors_addition/child_shut_down_with_supervisor  target: the board never preempts and an actor runs on the core that spawned it, so the busy slow child holds core 0 until it ends and the supervisor cannot end while it runs (spin depth 24 also takes over 300 s through stack-chunk crossings); supervisors_board_defects_addition/child_shut_down_with_supervisor_board moves the child to core 1 with migrate_actor instead
# ffi_addition runs in app-directory mode (board_suite.sh builds the board C fixtures with
# ffi_addition/fixtures_board.mk and links each app's silica.link archives). Only these trials are left out:
ffi_addition/dangerous_foreign_call_from_deep_stack      target: 100,000 Silica frames plus 150,000 C frames deep: megabytes of stack on a ~350 KB heap
ffi_addition/dangerous_spawn_thread_limit                target: spawns one OS thread per dangerous actor to hit the host's task limit; the board has no OS threads
ffi_addition/fault_before_main                           target: hosted process-fatal path (ELF constructor probe, hosted silica_rt_ffi_guarded_* entries, C main)
ffi_addition/fault_inside_handler                        target: hosted process-fatal path (C probe main, hosted fault-handler entries)
ffi_addition/foreign_fault_without_actor                 target: hosted process-fatal path (C probe main, dladdr, hosted guarded entries)
ffi_addition/dangerous_unguarded_null_deref_abort        target: its probe is a C main() that faults outside any actor (host executable); the board has no such process
ffi_addition/app_transport_tcp_loopback                  target: boards run one app at a time; the loopback app is host-only
# ffi_addition/app_sd18_worker_second_message has no sources (stale build products only): the driver reports it as having no program.
# ffi_addition/abi_addition and ffi_addition/module_addition are compile-only host phases with their own Makefiles
# (driver: the board driver skips any sub-suite that is not an app_* directory and reports it).
warning_enforcement_addition     target: builds C wrapper archives (FFI fixtures)
ordered_data_structures          driver: its shared stdlib build and leaf layout are not handled yet
compile_defects_trait_typed_record_call_x8_addition  driver: its stdlib units (wbt_map, OrderedMap) are symlinks in lib/, which the board driver does not stage (find -type f), so the board compile stops at E1009 unknown module wbt_map; the trial's check is the AArch64 .ascomp (X8 indirect-result register), which the board target does not compare
carriers_addition  target: excluded from the ESP32-S3_raw board run by request (the carriers suite is not run on the board)
actor_registration_addition/registry_many_names          target: designed to be too big for this platform (emitted code does not fit in ESP32-S3 RAM)
compile_defects_large_list_literal_frame_addition/defect_large_list_literal_frame          target: designed to be too big for this platform (emitted code does not fit in ESP32-S3 RAM)
transport_addition	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_bad_limits	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_byte_builtin_outside_sequence	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_closed_trait	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_decode_target	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_limits	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_marker_trait	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_missing_effect	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_no_region	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_not_on_target	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_not_transportable	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_region_unneeded	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_sum_variants	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_unknown_format	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
error_enforcement_addition/transport_err_unused_effect	target: transport is not yet working on this board; skipped for now
